  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "芋仔西米露"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳秋卉</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮兜附近有一間手tshi̍k茶店，內底有賣一款涼--ê——芋仔西米露，tsiânn好lim，阮爸買過一改了後，tsua̋n tiâu--leh，逐不時就走去買--兩-杯-仔tńg來that喙空。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">本底一杯50，尾--à起kah 60箍，照常買。後--來koh探聽--著，超過100箍就ē-sái外送到厝。Kan-na叫兩杯驚歹勢，伊lóng叫四杯，tiānn-tiānn kā阮脹--死。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一站仔m̄知是按怎，tiānn-tiānn買無，下晡就已經賣完--ah。有一改刁工駛車se̍h去beh買，mā是賣了--ah！想講明明就是芋仔加西米露，食材簡單，規氣家己來做，lim著mā bē hiah-nī甜。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">走去全聯，結果拄仔好無leh賣kan-na西谷米ê產品，有椰子奶口味ê西谷米，食材lóng kah好勢--ah，beh hōo人一改就做成功--ê。Bóng買，煮--起-來是bē歹食，m̄-koh阮兜愛食芋仔，mā是想beh做芋仔口味--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一改去食材用品店買mi̍h件，拄仔好siòng著有leh賣西谷米，一包tsiok大包，緊買--tńg-來，順suà買一khian芋仔tsiok大khian。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮母--à看著hit khian koh有外皮ê芋仔就面憂面kat，講he摸著手ē癢--死，tsiok歹處理。我應講：「你免煩惱，我ē-hiáu處理。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">開始料理：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1.芋仔頭先包一層灶跤紙巾，kā外皮khau-khau削削--leh，頭削了koh換削芋仔尾。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2.Kā芋仔切hōo細塊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">3.囥入去電鍋，外鍋內鍋lóng囥一khok ê水。開關跳--起-來了後hōo hip--一-下，外鍋koh囥一khok ê水。跳--起-來了後仝款小等--一-下。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">4.趁燒，kā芋仔tshi̍h-tshi̍h hōo散，摻糖，看beh偌甜在人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">5.電鍋leh煮芋仔ê時tsūn，用鼎仔另外煮西谷米，ná煮ná lā khah bē tiâu鼎，差不多煮十分鐘，煮kah西谷米看--起-來小可透明透明，khàm蓋hōo hip--一-下。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">6.Kā西米露hôo--起來，隨浸冷水。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">7.提絞果汁ê機器，kā芋仔、牛奶、水、冰角倒落去絞絞--leh，koh摻西米露，就完成--ah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫--起-來真簡單，舞beh一下晡，活beh忝--死。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結果西谷米買了siunn大包，一改煮無hiah-nī濟，只好分做三、四改來做，所有ê步數lóng ài照起工重來一改！（昏--倒）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上尾仔改ê西谷米煮煞了後，心肝頭ke偌輕鬆--leh。結論就是——iáu是買便--ê khah規氣--lah！應該hōo人趁--ê tio̍h-ài hōo人趁，家己做是趁健康兼趁無閒tshih-tshih！60箍khai--落-去，免驚bak著芋仔皮、免舞規半晡、免徛kah跤痠、免洗一堆碗公家私，ē和ē和、算俗--lah！</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVSDDB4T6Vvunyg46tbGSmlajDLLqyoecTceaAkCtBVuYV0t6JR4TcK_u8uZdK1peP7bYsk3OAlot2Mjod_JOSTD_wn8X94SjxeC76Dd8BRbuVECI0LBXk1BwPO7bncZ4lH2oeSAsy_hXl6BA9jamft3zlVvGccAOOUTODZ7C-YiaRlSeb-L5npnPXYS-z/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_040_b.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhVSDDB4T6Vvunyg46tbGSmlajDLLqyoecTceaAkCtBVuYV0t6JR4TcK_u8uZdK1peP7bYsk3OAlot2Mjod_JOSTD_wn8X94SjxeC76Dd8BRbuVECI0LBXk1BwPO7bncZ4lH2oeSAsy_hXl6BA9jamft3zlVvGccAOOUTODZ7C-YiaRlSeb-L5npnPXYS-z/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_040_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgh7gf1FT5NXkiu3Zo3wTAsM0SAuMfOzKSj0Zgkcniea0hDwTOZt-lta76wc7lHUw3XMfdetczEyWPwry68O_g5KXCGbqqn2kfWYBII1eHytfESUl-n2kY3jGi4oVa2jlXXVvWvzCyxebVFYWnrhFgfR_w4Akw9Cfz5VLM8iOyjGmbLvP7Uoy46hZ7C1qib/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_43.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgh7gf1FT5NXkiu3Zo3wTAsM0SAuMfOzKSj0Zgkcniea0hDwTOZt-lta76wc7lHUw3XMfdetczEyWPwry68O_g5KXCGbqqn2kfWYBII1eHytfESUl-n2kY3jGi4oVa2jlXXVvWvzCyxebVFYWnrhFgfR_w4Akw9Cfz5VLM8iOyjGmbLvP7Uoy46hZ7C1qib/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_43.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" 